Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: statements

    2 statements: statements statement
    3           | statement

    4 statement: ID '=' tree
    5          | PRINT ID
    6          | error

    7 tree: ID NUMBER
    8     | ID NUMBER '[' list ']'

    9 list: tree
   10     | list ',' tree


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    ',' (44) 10
    '=' (61) 4
    '[' (91) 8
    ']' (93) 8
    error (256) 6
    ID <str> (258) 4 5 7 8
    NUMBER <num> (259) 7 8
    PRINT (260) 5


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (10)
        on left: 0
    program (11)
        on left: 1
        on right: 0
    statements (12)
        on left: 2 3
        on right: 1 2
    statement (13)
        on left: 4 5 6
        on right: 2 3
    tree <node> (14)
        on left: 7 8
        on right: 4 9 10
    list <vec> (15)
        on left: 9 10
        on right: 8 10


State 0

    0 $accept: • program $end

    error  shift, and go to state 1
    ID     shift, and go to state 2
    PRINT  shift, and go to state 3

    program     go to state 4
    statements  go to state 5
    statement   go to state 6


State 1

    6 statement: error •

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (statement)


State 2

    4 statement: ID • '=' tree

    '='  shift, and go to state 7


State 3

    5 statement: PRINT • ID

    ID  shift, and go to state 8


State 4

    0 $accept: program • $end

    $end  shift, and go to state 9


State 5

    1 program: statements •
    2 statements: statements • statement

    error  shift, and go to state 1
    ID     shift, and go to state 2
    PRINT  shift, and go to state 3

    $end  reduce using rule 1 (program)

    statement  go to state 10


State 6

    3 statements: statement •

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (statements)


State 7

    4 statement: ID '=' • tree

    ID  shift, and go to state 11

    tree  go to state 12


State 8

    5 statement: PRINT ID •

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (statement)


State 9

    0 $accept: program $end •

    $default  accept


State 10

    2 statements: statements statement •

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (statements)


State 11

    7 tree: ID • NUMBER
    8     | ID • NUMBER '[' list ']'

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13


State 12

    4 statement: ID '=' tree •

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (statement)


State 13

    7 tree: ID NUMBER •
    8     | ID NUMBER • '[' list ']'

    '['  shift, and go to state 14

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (tree)


State 14

    8 tree: ID NUMBER '[' • list ']'

    ID  shift, and go to state 11

    tree  go to state 15
    list  go to state 16


State 15

    9 list: tree •

    $default  reduce using rule 9 (list)


State 16

    8 tree: ID NUMBER '[' list • ']'
   10 list: list • ',' tree

    ']'  shift, and go to state 17
    ','  shift, and go to state 18


State 17

    8 tree: ID NUMBER '[' list ']' •

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (tree)


State 18

   10 list: list ',' • tree

    ID  shift, and go to state 11

    tree  go to state 19


State 19

   10 list: list ',' tree •

    $default  reduce using rule 10 (list)
